Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS -- `gpresult` (Run box / ShellExecute) opens the Group Policy
; result tool (sg-gpresult), as it would run Microsoft's on Windows. For use as
; a bare command in cmd/PowerShell the tool also wants to be on the machine
; PATH; that is handled where the shell package installs its programs.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\App Paths\gpresult.exe]
@="Z:\\usr\\libexec\\stained-glass\\shell\\sg-gpresult64.exe"
